OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe odd shower possible over
OL,6,Fwestern Argyll early in the day.
OL,7,FOtherrwise a cold frosty start leading
OL,8,Fto a dry day with long periods of
OL,9,Fclear skies and sunshine. Breezy
OL,10,Fnortherly winds near the coasts.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FMostly cloudy night over
OL,13,FArgyll with a few showers possible
OL,14,Fovernight. Elsewhere will stay dry
OL,15,Fwith largely clear skies in the
OL,16,Fevening before turning cloudier
OL,17,Fovernight, cold and frosty here.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
