OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FA cloudy day with some bright
OL,6,For sunny intervals, the best of these
OL,7,Ffurther east inland. A few showers
OL,8,Fnear the coast and over Argyll then
OL,9,Ffurther inland later.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCloudy
OL,12,Fover the weekend with showers or
OL,13,Fperhaps longer spells of rain
OL,14,Fspreading north and east. Perhaps
OL,15,Fturning drier on Monday with some
OL,16,Fbrighter spells. Breezy at times. Less
OL,17,Fcold.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
